  <entry>
    <title>算法笔记</title>
    <link href="/learning-experience-blog/2026/07/15/%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95/"/>
    <url>/learning-experience-blog/2026/07/15/%E7%AE%97%E6%B3%95/</url>
    
    <content type="html"><![CDATA[<h1 id="前缀和，-差分，-离散化"><a href="#前缀和，-差分，-离散化" class="headerlink" title="前缀和， 差分， 离散化"></a>前缀和， 差分， 离散化</h1><h2 id="前缀和"><a href="#前缀和" class="headerlink" title="前缀和"></a>前缀和</h2><p>优点是多次区间查询每次都是O（1）</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class="hljs-type">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">1</span>; i &lt;= n; i += <span class="hljs-number">1</span>) &#123;<br>    cin &gt;&gt; a[i];<br>    pre[i] = pre[i<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>] + a[i];<br>&#125;<br><br>[l, r] -&gt; pre[r] - pre[l<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>]<br><br>pre[i][j] = pre[i<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>][j] + pre[i][j<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>] - pre[i<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>][j<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>] + a[i][j];<br><br>sum = pre[x2][y2] - pre[x1<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>][y2] -pre[x2][y2<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>] + pre[x1<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>][y1<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>];<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="差分"><a href="#差分" class="headerlink" title="差分"></a>差分</h2><p>优点在多次区间修改每次都是O（1）</p><p>左闭右闭（实心格子视角）</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-comment">// [l, r] + c</span><br>dif[l] += c;<br>dif[r<span class="hljs-number">+1</span>] -= c;<br><br>cur[i] = cur[i<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>] + dif[i];<br><br><span class="hljs-comment">// [x1, y1]-&gt; [x2, y2] += c</span><br>dif[x1][y1] += c;<br>dif[x1][y2<span class="hljs-number">+1</span>] -= c;<br>dif[x2<span class="hljs-number">+1</span>][y1] -= c;<br>dif[x2<span class="hljs-number">+1</span>][y2<span class="hljs-number">+1</span>] += c;<br><br><br>cur[i][j] = cur[i<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>][j] + cur[i][j<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>] - cur[i<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>][j<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>] + dif[i][j]<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>左闭右开（离散坐标点视角）</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp">直接 <br>dif[l] += <span class="hljs-number">1</span>;<br>dif[r] += <span class="hljs-number">1</span>;<br><br>cur[i] = cur[i<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>] + dif[i]<br><br>dif[X1][Y1] += <span class="hljs-number">1</span>;<br>dif[X2][Y1] -= <span class="hljs-number">1</span>; <br>dif[X1][Y2] -= <span class="hljs-number">1</span>;<br>dif[X2][Y2] += <span class="hljs-number">1</span>;<br><br>cur[i][j] = cur[i<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>][j] + cur[i][j<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>] - cur[i<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>][j<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>] + dif[i][j]<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="离散化"><a href="#离散化" class="headerlink" title="离散化"></a>离散化</h2><p>如果下标不是非负整数 -&gt;采用离散化（记录排名（一定是非负整数）来代替下标）</p><p>一个数组记录原本的数据<br>一个数组记录原本数据的排名（从小到大）<br>接着就可以差分了(或前缀和)</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><br><span class="hljs-built_in">sort</span>(arr.<span class="hljs-built_in">begin</span>(), arr.<span class="hljs-built_in">end</span>()); <span class="hljs-comment">// cmp 可选</span><br>arr.<span class="hljs-built_in">erase</span>(<span class="hljs-built_in">unique</span>(arr.<span class="hljs-built_in">begin</span>(), arr.<span class="hljs-built_in">end</span>()), arr.<span class="hljs-built_in">end</span>());去重来确保一一对应， 不会有相同数据对应不同值<br><span class="hljs-keyword">auto</span> find = [&amp;](<span class="hljs-type">int</span> val) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-built_in">lower_bound</span>(arr + <span class="hljs-number">1</span>, arr+n + <span class="hljs-number">1</span>, val) - arr.<span class="hljs-built_in">begin</span>();<br>&#125;<br><br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> totalSize = arr.<span class="hljs-built_in">size</span>();<br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class="hljs-type">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">0</span>; i &lt; totalSize; i += <span class="hljs-number">1</span>) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-type">int</span> xId = <span class="hljs-built_in">find</span>(data[i].x);得到排名<br>    ...<br>    差分<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><p>如果是多维度的， 比如二维， 那么分别记录x和y的排名， 只要能够一一对应回去就可保证算法的正确性</p><p>补充： 如果有多次区间查询， 修改同时进行， 则采用线段树（唯一缺点是写的麻烦）</p><h1 id="单调队列，-单调栈"><a href="#单调队列，-单调栈" class="headerlink" title="单调队列， 单调栈"></a>单调队列， 单调栈</h1><p>单调队列用来维护区间最值（习惯用队首维护最大或最小值）<br>单调栈用来寻找左边或右边第一个比他大或小的元素</p><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> n, a[N];<br>stack&lt;<span class="hljs-type">int</span>&gt; s;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class="hljs-type">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">1</span>; i &lt;= n; i += <span class="hljs-number">1</span>) &#123;<br>    cin &gt;&gt; a[i];<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> (!s.<span class="hljs-built_in">empty</span>() &amp;&amp; a[i] &lt; a[s.<span class="hljs-built_in">top</span>()]) &#123;<br>        ans[s.<span class="hljs-built_in">top</span>()] = i;<br>        s.<span class="hljs-built_in">pop</span>();<br>    &#125;<br>    s.<span class="hljs-built_in">push</span>(i);<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br><span class="line">18</span><br><span class="line">19</span><br><span class="line">20</span><br><span class="line">21</span><br><span class="line">22</span><br><span class="line">23</span><br><span class="line">24</span><br><span class="line">25</span><br><span class="line">26</span><br><span class="line">27</span><br><span class="line">28</span><br><span class="line">29</span><br><span class="line">30</span><br><span class="line">31</span><br><span class="line">32</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-type">int</span> n, k, a[N];<br>deque&lt;<span class="hljs-type">int</span>&gt; q;<br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class="hljs-type">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">1</span>; i &lt;= n; i += <span class="hljs-number">1</span>) &#123;<br>    cin &gt;&gt; a[i];<br>    <span class="hljs-comment">// [i - k + 1, i]</span><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> (!q.<span class="hljs-built_in">empty</span>() &amp;&amp; q.<span class="hljs-built_in">front</span>() &lt;= i - k) &#123;<br>        q.<span class="hljs-built_in">pop_front</span>();<br>    &#125;<br>    <br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> (!q.<span class="hljs-built_in">empty</span>() &amp;&amp; a[i] &lt;= a[q.<span class="hljs-built_in">back</span>()]) &#123;<br>        q.<span class="hljs-built_in">pop_back</span>();<br>    &#125;<br>    q.<span class="hljs-built_in">push</span>(i);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (i &gt;= k) &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-comment">// res = min(res, q.front());</span><br>        res = <span class="hljs-built_in">max</span>(res,q.<span class="hljs-built_in">front</span>());<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br><br>求不超过m的最大子段和<br>结合前缀和， 维护单调递增的连续子段和（对pre[i]来说，pre[q.<span class="hljs-built_in">front</span>()]为[i - m, i - <span class="hljs-number">1</span>]最小值）<br>  q.<span class="hljs-built_in">push_back</span>(<span class="hljs-number">0</span>);<br>  <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class="hljs-type">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">1</span>; i &lt;= n; i += <span class="hljs-number">1</span>) &#123;<br>    cin &gt;&gt; a[i];<br>    pre[i] = pre[i<span class="hljs-number">-1</span>] + a[i];<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> (!q.<span class="hljs-built_in">empty</span>() &amp;&amp; q.<span class="hljs-built_in">front</span>() &lt; i - m) q.<span class="hljs-built_in">pop_front</span>();<br>    res = <span class="hljs-built_in">max</span>(res, pre[i] - pre[q.<span class="hljs-built_in">front</span>()]);<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">while</span> (!q.<span class="hljs-built_in">empty</span>() &amp;&amp; pre[i] &lt; pre[q.<span class="hljs-built_in">back</span>()]) &#123;<br>      q.<span class="hljs-built_in">pop_back</span>();<br>    &#125;<br>    q.<span class="hljs-built_in">push_back</span>(i);<br>  &#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h1 id="数学"><a href="#数学" class="headerlink" title="数学"></a>数学</h1><h2 id="素数筛"><a href="#素数筛" class="headerlink" title="素数筛"></a>素数筛</h2><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br><span class="line">13</span><br><span class="line">14</span><br><span class="line">15</span><br><span class="line">16</span><br><span class="line">17</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-comment">// 原理： 合数一定是某个素数的倍数</span><br><span class="hljs-type">bool</span> notPrime[N];<br><span class="hljs-type">int</span> n;<br>vector&lt;<span class="hljs-type">int</span>&gt; primes;<br><br><span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class="hljs-type">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">2</span>; i &lt;= n; i += <span class="hljs-number">1</span>) &#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (notPrime[i]) &#123;<br>        v.<span class="hljs-built_in">push_back</span>(i);<br>    &#125;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class="hljs-type">int</span> prime : primes) &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (i * prime &gt; n) <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>;<br>        notPrime[i * prime] = <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (i % prime == <span class="hljs-number">0</span>) <br>        <span class="hljs-comment">// 因为到 i * prime &gt; n才停， 所以现在肯定已经被其他素数筛过了</span><br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">break</span>;<br>    &#125;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><figure class="highlight cpp"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br><span class="line">2</span><br><span class="line">3</span><br><span class="line">4</span><br><span class="line">5</span><br><span class="line">6</span><br><span class="line">7</span><br><span class="line">8</span><br><span class="line">9</span><br><span class="line">10</span><br><span class="line">11</span><br><span class="line">12</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs cpp"><span class="hljs-comment">// 原理： 素数满足 6n + 1 或 6n - 1的形式， 且因为因数是成对出现， 只需要判断 i * i &lt;= n 范围即可</span><br><span class="hljs-function"><span class="hljs-type">bool</span> <span class="hljs-title">isPrime</span><span class="hljs-params">(<span class="hljs-type">int</span> x)</span> </span>&#123;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (x &lt;= <span class="hljs-number">1</span>) <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">false</span>;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (x &lt;= <span class="hljs-number">3</span>) <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (x % <span class="hljs-number">2</span> == <span class="hljs-number">0</span> || x % <span class="hljs-number">3</span> == <span class="hljs-number">0</span>) <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">false</span>;<br><br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class="hljs-type">int</span> i = <span class="hljs-number">5</span>; i * i &lt;= n; i += <span class="hljs-number">6</span>) &#123;<br>        <span class="hljs-keyword">if</span> (n % i == <span class="hljs-number">0</span> || n % (i + <span class="hljs-number">2</span>) == <span class="hljs-number">0</span>) <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">false</span>;<br>    &#125;<br>    <span class="hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class="hljs-literal">true</span>;<br>&#125;<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure><h2 id="gcd-a-b-and-lcm-a-b"><a href="#gcd-a-b-and-lcm-a-b" class="headerlink" title="gcd(a, b) and lcm(a, b)"></a>gcd(a, b) and lcm(a, b)</h2><figure class="highlight livecodeserver"><table><tr><td class="gutter"><pre><span class="line">1</span><br></pre></td><td class="code"><pre><code class="hljs livecodeserver"><span class="hljs-keyword">a</span> * b = gcd(<span class="hljs-keyword">a</span>, b) * lcm(<span class="hljs-keyword">a</span>, b)<br></code></pre></td></tr></table></figure>]]></content>
    
    
    
